{
  "format_version": "3.0",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
  "format_name": "Heroes of Might and Magic III - Shadow of Death / HotA save file (.GM1) — universal format constants",
  "notes": [
    "All absolute offsets were removed in v3.0 — they are now computed",
    "dynamically by map_config_builder.py from a day-zero save.",
    "",
    "This file now contains ONLY universal format constants:",
    "  - constants: magic bytes, player colors, version codes",
    "  - path_block: 7 path record types (universal)",
    "  - field_offsets: relative offsets within hero/town blocks (universal)",
    "  - known_unknowns: research TODO list",
    "",
    "For per-map absolute offsets, use map_config_<mapname>.json",
    "(produced by Phase 2 = map_config_builder.py).",
    "",
    "Three-phase architecture:",
    "  Phase 1: map_json_loader.py        → MapData (any map)",
    "  Phase 2: map_config_builder.py     → MapConfig (per-map, from day-0 save)",
    "  Phase 3: save_parser.py            → ParsedSave (any save, using MapConfig)",
    "",
    "Coordinate encoding: coord_int = x | (y << 8) | (z << 16)",
    "  z=0 surface, z=1 underground",
    "",
    "Hero block stride: 0x446 = 1094 bytes (SoD/HotA)",
    "Hero name is at offset 169 from block start (h3sed convention)",
    "Town name is at offset 71 from block start",
    "",
    "Movement cost: 100 per horizontal/vertical step, 141 per diagonal",
    "Movement is also modified by terrain, roads, artifacts, hero class,",
    "building bonuses (e.g. Stables)."
  ],
